      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "CreativeWork",
      "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-2",
      "position": 2,
      "name": "What’s inside",
      "text": "What’s Inside\nSee what we do, how we work, and where we can \ntake your next big idea.\n01. Introduction\n02. Services\n06. Next Step\n04. Who We Are\n03. Case Studies\n05. Engagement\nOrbix Studio",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-2",
      "image": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/assets/slides/02.webp",
      "isPartOf": {
        "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#deck"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "CreativeWork",
      "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-3",
      "position": 3,
      "name": "Ambitious digital experiences",
      "text": "Product × Design × Growth\nbusinesses forward\nexperiences that\nmove\nWe build\nambitious\ndigital\nBy bringing brand, product, and technology together, we help \nteams launch and scale with confidence\nC l e a r e r P r o d u c t s\nB r i g h t e r g r o w t h\nOrbix Studio",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-3",
      "image": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/assets/slides/03.webp",
      "isPartOf": {
        "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#deck"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "CreativeWork",
      "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-4",
      "position": 4,
      "name": "Our core proposition",
      "text": "Product × Design × Growth\nOur Core \nProposition\nTraditional agencies deliver polished visuals. We \nbuild clear, scalable product systems that help \nambitious businesses grow.\nStrategy\nDesign\nBuild\nScale\nScalable\nSystems\nDesign and build for\nlong-term growth\nHappier\nCustomers\nBetter  experience\nStronger relationships\nBusiness\nImpact\n+300%\nOrbix Studio",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-4",
      "image": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/assets/slides/04.webp",
      "isPartOf": {
        "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#deck"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "CreativeWork",
      "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-5",
      "position": 5,
      "name": "The problems we solve",
      "text": "Product × Design × Growth\nThe Problems\nWe Solve\n01\n02\nInconsistent brand \nexperiences that weaken \ncustomer trust\nWebsites that attract \nvisitors but fail to convert\nOrbix Studio\nDesign gaps can weaken customer trust and \nslow development. We help resolve the issues \nholding your business back.\n03\n04\nComplex products that \nmake everyday tasks \ndifficult\nIncomplete design handoffs \nthat cause rework and delay \nlaunches",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-5",
      "image": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/assets/slides/05.webp",
      "isPartOf": {
        "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#deck"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "CreativeWork",
      "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-6",
      "position": 6,
      "name": "Better product experiences",
      "text": "Product × Design × Growth\nWhen your product is hard to use, users leave \nand growth slows. We help you fix what's \nholding your product back and build better \nexperiences that drive growth.\nClear UX. Scalable systems. \nDEVELOPMENT\nBetter product \nexperiences.\nOrbix Studio",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-6",
      "image": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/assets/slides/06.webp",
      "isPartOf": {
        "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#deck"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "CreativeWork",
      "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-7",
      "position": 7,
      "name": "Our design process",
      "text": "Product × Design × Growth\nOur Design\nProcess\nWe take your product from idea to launch in three \nphases: Discover the right opportunities, design better \nuser experiences, and build a product ready to grow.\n01\n02\n03\nOrbix Studio\nDiscover\nWe uncover user needs, \nbusiness goals, and product \nchallenges through research.\nDesign\nWe transform those insights into \nintuitive flows, interfaces, and \nscalable systems.\nBuild\nWe bring the design to life \nwith polished UI and \ndeveloper-ready handoff.",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-7",
      "image": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/assets/slides/07.webp",
      "isPartOf": {
        "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#deck"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "CreativeWork",
      "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-8",
      "position": 8,
      "name": "Why product-led design matters",
      "text": "Product × Design × Growth\nWhy Product-Led\nDesign Matters\nPoor product experiences lead to lower conversions and higher churn. Product-led design helps \nyou improve usability, retain customers, and support long-term growth.\nFaster Onboarding\nHigher Conversion\nStronger Retention\nScalable Feature expansion\nLong-Term Brand Value\nOrbix Studio",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-8",
      "image": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/assets/slides/08.webp",
      "isPartOf": {
        "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#deck"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "CreativeWork",
      "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-9",
      "position": 9,
      "name": "From design to development",
      "text": "Product × Design × Growth\n95+\n4.95/5\n$5B\nProducts & projects \ndelivered\n10 Years\nAverage client \nsatisfaction\nEverything Your Product Need,\nFrom Design to Development\nOrbix Studio\nCombined client \nvaluation\nBuilding digital \nproducts globally",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-9",
      "image": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/assets/slides/09.webp",
      "isPartOf": {
        "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#deck"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "CreativeWork",
      "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-10",
      "position": 10,
      "name": "Strategy & research",
      "text": "Product × Design × Growth\nStrategy &\nResearch\nWe look beyond the obvious to understand your users, \nmarket, and product. By uncovering unmet needs and \nopportunities, we give every design decision a clear \ndirection and a stronger business purpose.\nUsability\nUX/UI Design\nPerformance\nApps\nOrbix Studio",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-10",
      "image": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/assets/slides/10.webp",
      "isPartOf": {
        "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#deck"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "CreativeWork",
      "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-11",
      "position": 11,
      "name": "Brand systems",
      "text": "Product × Design × Growth\nBrand \nSystems\nOrbix Studio\nA strong brand is more than a \nlogo. We create flexible systems that \nkeep every product, campaign, and \ncustomer touchpoint visually aligned \nas the business grows.",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-11",
      "image": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/assets/slides/11.webp",
      "isPartOf": {
        "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#deck"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "CreativeWork",
      "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-12",
      "position": 12,
      "name": "Interface design",
      "text": "Orbix Studio\nProduct × Design × Growth\nInterface \nDesign\nYour interface is where customers \nexperience your product. We design \nclear layouts, visual hierarchy, and UI \nsystems that guide actions while \nmaintaining consistency.\nCardiologist\nDr. Vetrick W.\nHigh Blood Pressure (Hypertension) \nheart rate: 132 bpm \n9.20\n6.10\nHgb\nRBC\n10:00 AM\nMonthly Expense\nThis Month\n60%\n20%\n5%\n15%\nProtein\n7\nDays\nHydration\n8%\n2.6 L\nBalance\n12\nMeals\nVitamins\nFiber\n76%\n5 Days\nSugar\nDaily Needs\nSavings\nShopping\nOthers\n9/12\n9/12\nPain Level Increased \nPatient reports pain level at 7 out of 10 an increase.\nSwelling Progressing\nThe patient’s pain severity has worsened recently.\nIncrease in Pain Level Noted\nThe patient mentions their pain has gotten more intense.\nHigh\nEnter Amount\n$250.00\nDoctor Profile\nUSD\nOlivia Smith\nDr. Maya Bennett\nPhilosophy\nAvailable\nCritical\nPhone Number\nEmail Address\n+ (444) 654 - 4326\nmayabenne@gmail.com\nMessage\nAddress\n123 Maple Street, 6542\nBook Appointment\nHigh\nEstimated Delivery\nInstant – 10 min\nAlex Morgan",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-12",
      "image": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/assets/slides/12.webp",
      "isPartOf": {
        "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#deck"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "CreativeWork",
      "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-13",
      "position": 13,
      "name": "UX architecture",
      "text": "ud Score\nOrbix Studio\nProduct × Design × Growth\nUX \nArchitecture\nAs products grow, structure becomes \nessential. We structure the information \nhierarchy and workflow logic that \norganize complex product systems.\nAsk anything...\nInbox\nDashboard\nInbox\nTotal Note\n128 Notes\n3\n+243 \nCollaborate with friends and \nstudy together anytime\nClaude 3.5\n12 Folders\nJordan Taylor\nI’d appreciate an estimat\n12\nJamie Parker\nI’d like to reques\n12 Folders\nAlexandr\n112\nCould \n32\nU\n12\n2\nTotal Note\n5\nFreud Score\nJournal\nInbox\nJournal\nYour Inbox\nYour Inbox\nMentions\nCreated by you\nUnassigned\n128 Notes\n6 open\n+243 \n3\nCollaborate with friends and \nstudy together anytime\n6\n80\nHealthy\n25/365\nNormal\n25/365\nNormal\n112\n32\n8\n0\nSent",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-13",
      "image": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/assets/slides/13.webp",
      "isPartOf": {
        "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#deck"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "CreativeWork",
      "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-14",
      "position": 14,
      "name": "Product design & development",
      "text": "Product × Design × Growth\n01\nProduct \nDesign\nTurn your idea into a product \nthat's easy to use,& built around \nwhat your customers need.\n02\nDevelopment \nCapabilities\nClean, scalable implementation \nthat keeps design and \nengineering closely aligned.\nOrbix Studio\nDesign Systems \n& Scalability\nReusable components and patterns \nthat help products grow without losing \nconsistency.\n03\n04\nAI & Automation \nIntegration\nSmart workflows and automation \nintegrated where they create real \nproduct value.",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-14",
      "image": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/assets/slides/14.webp",
      "isPartOf": {
        "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#deck"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "CreativeWork",
      "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-15",
      "position": 15,
      "name": "Our full-cycle design process",
      "text": "Product × Design × Growth\nOur Full Cycle\nProduct Design \nProcess\nFrom the initial plan to ongoing \nimprovements, we help you shape, build, and \nrefine your product.\nOrbix Studio\nStrategic Alignment\nObjectives, stakeholder mapping, and measurable \nsuccess criteria defined upfront.\nSystem Design\nUX architecture, design systems, and interface \nframeworks built to specification.\nImplementation Support\nEngineering collaboration, dev-ready handoffs, \nand QA validation across milestones.\nIterative Optimization\nPerformance tracking, feature expansion, and \ncontinuous improvement cycles.",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-15",
      "image": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/assets/slides/15.webp",
      "isPartOf": {
        "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#deck"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "CreativeWork",
      "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-16",
      "position": 16,
      "name": "From discovery to optimization",
      "text": "Product × Design × Growth\n01\n02\n03\n04\n05\n06\n07\n08\nOrbix Studio\nExecutive Discovery & Objective Definition\nResearch & Risk Assessment\nArchitecture & Experience Framework\nInterface System Development\nPrototype Validation\nEngineering Alignment & Implementation\nQuality Assurance & Performance Testing\nLaunch & Ongoing Optimization",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-16",
      "image": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/assets/slides/16.webp",
      "isPartOf": {
        "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#deck"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "CreativeWork",
      "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-17",
      "position": 17,
      "name": "Detailed project workflow",
      "text": "Product × Design × Growth\nDetailed Project \nWorkflow\nFrom the first meeting to launch, every project follows a clear plan. You know \nwhat we're working on, what you'll receive at each stage, and how the project is \nprogressing.\nOrbix Studio",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-17",
      "image": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/assets/slides/17.webp",
      "isPartOf": {
        "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#deck"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "CreativeWork",
      "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-18",
      "position": 18,
      "name": "Growth without the chaos",
      "text": "Product × Design × Growth\nFewer Costly \nMistakes\nCatch issues early. \nAvoid costly rework.\nTeams \nWorking in \nSync\nAlign teams and goals to \nkeep projects moving.\nOrbix Studio\nGrowthWithout \nthe Chaos\nBuild a strong \nfoundation for growth.",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-18",
      "image": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/assets/slides/18.webp",
      "isPartOf": {
        "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#deck"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "CreativeWork",
      "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-19",
      "position": 19,
      "name": "Measured impact",
      "text": "Measured \nImpact\nBetter product experiences lead to better \nbusiness outcomes from converting more \nusers to helping teams ship faster.\n01\n02\n03\nConversion Rate \nOptimization \nClearer interfaces and smoother user journeys \nhelp more people complete key actions.\nOnboarding \nEfficiency \nA simpler first-time experience helps new users \nunderstand your product and reach value sooner.\nFeature Release \nVelocity \nConsistent design and clear developer handoffs help \nteams build and release features with less rework.",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-19",
      "image": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/assets/slides/19.webp",
      "isPartOf": {
        "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#deck"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "CreativeWork",
      "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-20",
      "position": 20,
      "name": "Better workflows, stronger retention",
      "text": "Product × Design × Growth\nDesign & \nDevelopment \nRework \nStructured documentation and \nalignment processes significantly \nreduce costly back-and.\nUser \nFriction in \nWorkflows \nClearer onboarding flows and reduced \nfriction accelerate time-to-value for \nnew users.\nEnterprise \nUsability & \nRetention \nProducts designed for enterprise-grade \nusability experience stronger long-term \nretention and.\nOrbix Studio",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-20",
      "image": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/assets/slides/20.webp",
      "isPartOf": {
        "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#deck"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "CreativeWork",
      "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-21",
      "position": 21,
      "name": "Performance metrics",
      "text": "Orbix Studio\nProduct × Design × Growth\nperformance\nWe focus\nmetrics\nn\nnot visuals\noutput alone",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-21",
