    {
      "@type": "CreativeWork",
      "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-37",
      "position": 37,
      "name": "Our story",
      "text": "Product × Design × Growth\nOur\nStory\nOribix Studio started with a simple belief: digital \nproducts should bring clarity, not complexity. As \nproducts grew, we saw brand, UX, and engineering \ndrifting apart. Today, we help teams bring them back \ntogether to build products that scale.\nOrbix Studio",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-37",
      "image": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/assets/slides/37.webp",
      "isPartOf": {
        "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#deck"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "CreativeWork",
      "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-38",
      "position": 38,
      "name": "Mission & vision",
      "text": "Product × Design × Growth\nMission\n& Vision\nMission\nTO DESIGN AND BUILD DIGITAL \nPRODUCTS THAT SOLVE REAL \nPROBLEMS, DELIVER LASTING VALUE, \nAND HELP BUSINESSES GROW.\nOrbix Studio\nVision\nTO BECOME A TRUSTED GLOBAL \nPRODUCT PARTNER, HELPING \nAMBITIOUS COMPANIES BUILD BETTER \nSAAS, FINTECH, AND ENTERPRISE \nPRODUCTS.",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-38",
      "image": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/assets/slides/38.webp",
      "isPartOf": {
        "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#deck"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "CreativeWork",
      "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-39",
      "position": 39,
      "name": "Our core values",
      "text": "Product × Design × Growth\nOur Core\nValues\nLong-Term \nThinking\nProducts built to adapt, grow, and stay \nuseful long after launch.\nStructure \nOver Noise\nClarity and systems over trends, visual \nexcess, or short-lived design patterns.\nAccountability\nClear deliverables, shared ownership, \nand transparent collaboration at \nevery stage.\nOrbix Studio\nStrategy Before \nExecution\nEvery decision is anchored in business \nlogic and measurable objectives.\nContinuous \nImprovement\nProducts get better through user \nfeedback, careful testing, and \nongoing refinement.",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-39",
      "image": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/assets/slides/39.webp",
      "isPartOf": {
        "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#deck"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "CreativeWork",
      "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-40",
      "position": 40,
      "name": "Product-first philosophy",
      "text": "Product × Design × Growth\nProduct-First \nPhilosophy\nGreat products start with the right idea. We focus on what \nmatters to your users, simplify what doesn't, and turn your \nvision into a product built to last.\nOrbix Studio",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-40",
      "image": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/assets/slides/40.webp",
      "isPartOf": {
        "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#deck"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "CreativeWork",
      "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-41",
      "position": 41,
      "name": "Our team structure",
      "text": "Orbix Studio\nProduct × Design × Growth\nOur Team \nStructure\nDesigners and developers work as one team, from the \nfirst idea to the final build. This close collaboration \ngives your product the space to grow, evolve, and \nreach its full potential.",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-41",
      "image": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/assets/slides/41.webp",
      "isPartOf": {
        "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#deck"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "CreativeWork",
      "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-42",
      "position": 42,
      "name": "Our product disciplines",
      "text": "Product × Design × Growth\n01\nProduct\nStrategists\n04\nFrontend\nEngineers\n02\nUX\nArchitects\n05\nProjects &\nDelivery\n03\nUI & Design\nSystem\nOrbix Studio",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-42",
      "image": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/assets/slides/42.webp",
      "isPartOf": {
        "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#deck"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "CreativeWork",
      "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-43",
      "position": 43,
      "name": "Departments & capabilities",
      "text": "Product × Design × Growth\nDepartments \n& Capabilities\nOur structure is built around three core pillars that \nkeep strategy, design, and development aligned \nacross every engagement.\nOrbix Studio\nStrategy & Research\nPilar 01\nPositioning, product strategy, UX research, \nand architecture planning.\nDesign & Systems\nPilar 02\nBrand systems, UX frameworks, interface \ndesign, and scalable component libraries.\nDevelopment &\nImplementation\nPilar 03\nFront-end collaboration, system documentation, \nQA alignment, and performance optimization.",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-43",
      "image": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/assets/slides/43.webp",
      "isPartOf": {
        "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#deck"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "CreativeWork",
      "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-44",
      "position": 44,
      "name": "Remote & global collaboration",
      "text": "Product × Design × Growth\nRemote & Global \nCollaboration Model\nOrbix Studio brings designers and developers together from around the world to build better digital products \nthrough clear communication and close collaboration, turning bold ideas into meaningful experiences that \ncreate lasting business value.\nOrbix Studio",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-44",
      "image": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/assets/slides/44.webp",
      "isPartOf": {
        "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#deck"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "CreativeWork",
      "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-45",
      "position": 45,
      "name": "How we structure engagements",
      "text": "Orbix Studio\nProduct × Design × Growth\nHow We Structure \nEngagements\nEvery engagement at Orbix Studio begins with clear objectives, defined scope, and aligned \nteams. This keeps the work focused, accountable, and moving forward from the start.\nClear Objectives & KPIs\nDefined Scope Boundaries\nMilestone-Based Delivery\nExecutive Reporting Cadence\nGovernance & Approval Gates",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-45",
      "image": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/assets/slides/45.webp",
      "isPartOf": {
        "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#deck"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "CreativeWork",
      "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-46",
      "position": 46,
      "name": "Ongoing product growth",
      "text": "Orbix Studio\nProduct × Design × Growth\nRetainer Model for \nOngoing Product \nGrowth\nAs your product evolves, We stay by your side to \nimprove existing features, build new ones, and keep \nyour product aligned with changing user needs.",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-46",
      "image": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/assets/slides/46.webp",
      "isPartOf": {
        "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#deck"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "CreativeWork",
      "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-47",
      "position": 47,
      "name": "Product launch program",
      "text": "Product × Design × Growth\nProduct \nLaunch \nProgram\n01\n02\nOur product launch program helps startups and \nenterprises reduce risk and prepare brand, product, \nand performance for release or relaunch.\n03\nOrbix Studio\nFoundation\nPositioning, product strategy, UX research, \nand architecture planning.\nBuild\nBrand systems, UX frameworks, interface \ndesign, and scalable component libraries.\nLaunch\nFront-end collaboration, system documentation, \nQA alignment, and performance optimization.",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-47",
      "image": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/assets/slides/47.webp",
      "isPartOf": {
        "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#deck"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "CreativeWork",
      "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-48",
      "position": 48,
      "name": "Our collaboration framework",
      "text": "Product × Design × Growth\nOur \nCollaboration \nFramework\nOrbix Studio helps startups and enterprises reduce \nrisk and prepare brand, product, and performance for \nrelease or relaunch.\n       Executive \nkickoff alignment:\n01\n       Defined \nstakeholder roles:\n02\n       Weekly \nsprint reviews:\n03\n        Milestone reporting and \ndocumentation transparency:\n04\nOrbix Studio\nObjectives, roles, and success \ncriteria defined before work begins.\nClear ownership across client and \nOrbix teams with no ambiguity.\nProgress updates with documented \noutcomes and next steps.\nClear progress, documented \ndecisions, and milestone visibility.",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-48",
      "image": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/assets/slides/48.webp",
      "isPartOf": {
        "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#deck"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "CreativeWork",
      "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-49",
      "position": 49,
      "name": "Average project timelines",
      "text": "Product × Design × Growth\nAverage\n P\nroject \nTimelines\nProject timelines depend on the scope, \ncomplexity, and feedback involved. These \nestimates cover the full process, from initial \nresearch and design to development handoff.\nBrand Strategy\nMarketing Website \n(Design & Build)\nSaaS Product Design\nEnterprise \nDashboard Systems\nDesign System \nDevelopment\nOrbix Studio\n4–8 weeks\n6–16 weeks\n8–24 weeks\n12–32 weeks\n6–12 weeks",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-49",
      "image": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/assets/slides/49.webp",
      "isPartOf": {
        "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#deck"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "CreativeWork",
      "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-50",
      "position": 50,
      "name": "Investment ranges",
      "text": "Product × Design × Growth\nInvestment \nRanges\nProject pricing varies based on scope, complexity, \nand product requirements. The ranges below \nreflect common engagement ranges.\nBrand Systems\nMarketing Website \n(Design & Development)\nSaaS Product Design\nEnterprise Product \nSystems\nRetainer \nPartnerships\nOrbix Studio\n$15K – $50K\n$25K – $80K\n$30K – $120K\nCustom Scoping\nCustom Monthly Structure",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-50",
      "image": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/assets/slides/50.webp",
      "isPartOf": {
        "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#deck"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "CreativeWork",
      "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-51",
      "position": 51,
      "name": "What sets us apart",
      "text": "Product × Design × Growth\n01\nWhat Sets \nUs Apart\n02\n03\n04\nWe combine thoughtful design, \ntechnical expertise, and business \ngoals to build products that solve real \nproblems, deliver measurable results, \nand grow with your business.\n05\nOrbix Studio\nFull-Cycle \nIntegration\nBrand, UX, and product \nbuilt as one system.\nSystem-First \nThinking\nScalable systems \ndesigned for growth.\nExecutive-Level \nAlignment\nClear communication \nand faster decisions.\nMeasurable \nImpact\nFocused on \nperformance and real \noutcomes.\nLong-Term \nPartnership Mindset\nOngoing support \nbeyond launch.",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-51",
      "image": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/assets/slides/51.webp",
      "isPartOf": {
        "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#deck"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "CreativeWork",
      "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-52",
      "position": 52,
      "name": "Let’s build what matters",
      "text": "Product × Design × Growth\nWhat Matters\nLet’s Build\nOrbix Studio partners with organizations that take their digital \ninfrastructure seriously.\nOrbix Studio",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-52",
      "image": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/assets/slides/52.webp",
