      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "CreativeWork",
      "@id": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-57",
      "position": 57,
      "name": "Contact & next steps",
      "text": "Orbix Studio\nProduct × Design × Growth\nContact & \nNext Steps\nLet’s talk About Your Product\nStart with a discovery call to align on your goals, \nchallenges, and next steps.\nStep 01\nStep 02\nStep 03\nAlignment Call\nGoals, priorities, and current state.\nScope & Proposal\nDeliverables, timeline, and investment.\nRoadmap & Kickoff\nPlan, team alignment, and project launch.\nHave a project in mind?\nhello@orbix.studio\nOrbix Studio\nLet’s Build What’s Next.\nPrefer to talk?\n+1 (646) 598-7983",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/read/#slide-57",
      "image": "http://127.0.0.1:5188/assets/slides/57.webp",
